## Jetson Development

| Machine | Workspace | Access |
|---------|-----------|--------|
| Dev PC | `~/maher_ws` | local |
| Jetson | `~/jetson_ws` | `ssh ubuntu@192.168.2.138` (DHCP — update if changed; alias `jetrover` may work) |

**Bringup (Jetson, before ROS 2 work):**

```bash
sudo systemctl stop start_app_node.service
cd ~/jetson_ws && source install/setup.bash
```

**Build this package on Jetson (once):**

```bash
cd ~/jetson_ws/src && git clone <repo-url> Recognition-of-Different-Colored-Cubes
cd ~/jetson_ws
colcon build --packages-select recognition_of_different_colored_cubes --symlink-install
source install/setup.bash
```

---

