**Next step:** On Jetson — stop auto-start, start/verify vendor camera topic:

```bash
ssh ubuntu@192.168.2.138
sudo systemctl stop start_app_node.service
cd ~/jetson_ws && source install/setup.bash
export need_compile=True
export MACHINE_TYPE=JetRover_Mecanum
export LIDAR_TYPE=LD19
export HOST=/
export MASTER=
export DEPTH_CAMERA_TYPE=Dabai
ros2 launch peripherals depth_camera.launch.py
# in another sourced terminal:
ros2 topic list
ros2 topic hz /depth_cam/rgb/image_raw
ros2 run rqt_image_view rqt_image_view
```

> Update this section each time a milestone or step is completed.
